&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height:15pt;min-height:15pt;"&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;line-height:15pt;font-size:10.5pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;font-size:9pt;"&gt; 繰延税金資産(繰延税金負債と相殺前)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
